WEBVTT

52:01.853 --> 52:04.981
As for myself, I don't
require a large room.

52:05.107 --> 52:10.070
- Truly, my lord, we have nothing.
- Is there nothing I can do...

52:10.195 --> 52:12.531
- (COIN CLANKS)
- ..to remedy this?

52:12.656 --> 52:15.951
- You can have my room.
- Now there's a clever man.

52:17.536 --> 52:20.288
You can manage food, I trust?
Yoren, dine with me.

52:20.414 --> 52:22.332
- Aye, my lord.
- My lord of Lannister!

52:22.457 --> 52:25.001
Might I entertain you while you eat?

52:25.127 --> 52:27.879
I can sing of your father's victory
at King's Landing!

52:28.004 --> 52:31.591
Nothing would more likely
ruin my supper.
